+        ///   each of the above re-FABRICATES: encode -> a type-1 frame -> the REAL ParseView -> the parsed block is served
+        ///   as the BENCH end (TryGetPeerEnd, Bench = true; its wire seq advances per fabricate). A round trip that does not
+        ///   reproduce every field FAILS the verb. The next own battle's rising edge disarms it (DisarmStaleBenchEnd).
